{
  "name": "Automated Supplier KYB, OFAC Sanctions & GLEIF Corporate Ownership Gate",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Supplier KYB, OFAC Sanctions & GLEIF Corporate Ownership Gate\n\n**Category:** SecOps & FinOps Compliance\n\nScreens B2B suppliers against OFAC SDN, UN, EU and Interpol watchlists in parallel with GLEIF LEI parent-company ownership verification before approving onboarding or high-value payouts.\n\n**Cloud Scheduling:** Compatible with self-hosted n8n and n8n Cloud (https://n8n.io/cloud/).",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "wf1-sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Quick Setup (< 2 Minutes)\n\n1. Get a free API key on RapidAPI (**15 free runs/month**, PRO `$19/mo`):\n   `https://rapidapi.com/user/b2bquantapis`\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - **Name:** `X-RapidAPI-Key`\n   - **Value:** `YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY`\n3. Select that credential in both **HTTP Request** compliance nodes below.\n4. Replace `https://httpbin.org/post` in the Escalation node with your Slack, Teams, or Jira webhook.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "wf1-sticky-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scoring & Conditional Gate\n\n- The **Code** node merges responses from both engines, removes duplicates, and computes `riskScore` (`0–100`).\n- **High Priority (`riskScore >= 60`)** routes to the real-time **Escalation Webhook**.\n- **Standard / Clean (`riskScore < 60`)** logs a structured JSON audit record ready for Postgres, S3, or Google Sheets.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "wf1-sticky-3",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Routing Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 6 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "wf1-trigger",
      "name": "Scheduled Compliance Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
